                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pierce to Mr. Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-02-10"><hi rendition="#italic">February 10,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Disarmament conference will be held at The Hague.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Pierce.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
